  ' type: Natural language programming
  ' target: fullstack app, data storage, ai features, authentification
  ' stack: React + TypeScript + (cosmos DB key-value store)
  ' development interface: prompt, visual tool, code
  ' remote dev: GitHubCodeSpace
  ' execution: fully managed runtime
  ' One click deployement
  ' One click github repository
  ' App can embed AI capabilities (smart software)
  ' Autenthication with GitHub users.
  ' Input: Prompt + image (Mocks, sketches, or screenshots).
  ' Live, interactive preview of the app
  ' Spark environment + synchronized code space + github repo 2 way-synch
  ' Sharing to spark: view/interact the app, as readonly ?
  ' limitations :
  '    - library, to test
  '    - data store visible by all user/developer?


#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Gpbal concepts
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

User
  + sparks: Spark[*]



Spark
  ' A _Spark is an application created via the _GitHubSparkTool
  - ![view](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df4e1749-5086-4b55-8462-4a58c82c5b00)
  - name: String
  - status: unpublished | published | hasUnpublishedChanges
  - visibility: private | organization | githubUsers
  - publishedURL: URL[0..1] 
  + chat: Chat                         ' See _IteratePanel
     ' only one _Chat, the first _Prompt, then _Prompt for improvements
  + repository: Repository[0..1]      ' GitHub repository
  + codeSpace: CodeSpace[0..1]
  + owner: Owner[0..1]             
  + theme: Theme                      ' See _ThemePanel
  + data: Data                        ' See _DataPanel
  + prompts: Prompt[*]                ' See _PromptPanel
      ' AI capabilities can be added to the _Spark by asking in the _Chat.
      ' The _Prompts powering these features can ne seen in the _PromptPanel.
      ??? make the difference between _Prompts from _Chat and these _Prompts.
  + assets: Files[*]                  ' See _Assets
  - publish()

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Theme concepts
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
Theme
  ' [doc](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/tutorials/spark/build-apps-with-spark#step-3-customize-the-styling-of-your-app)
  ' See _ThemePanel.
  + typography: ...
  + color: ...
  + appearance: ...

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Data concepts
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Data
  ' A _Data section is associated with each _Spark (see "Data" tab).
  ' This allows to examine both the _DataModel and the data itself.
  ' [doc](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/tutorials/spark/build-apps-with-spark#step-4-store-and-manage-data)
  ' See _DataPanel
  + dataModel: DataModel[0..1]
  + rows:Row[0..*]

DataModel
  ' unamed
  + tables: Table[*]

Table
  - name: String
  + /idColumn: Column
  + columns: Column[*]{ordered}
  - /nbOfRows: Integer
  + rows: Rows[*]
  - /json: JSON

Column
  - name: String

Row
  - table: Table opposite of rows
  + slots: Slot[*]
  - /json: JSON

Slot
  ' unamed
  ' A _Slot can contains multiple values when the cardinality is multiple
  + column: Column
  - values: String[*]

#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Chat concepts
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Chat
  ' Serie of _Interactions leading to the current state of the _Spark.
  ' See _IteratePanel
  - status: ready | working
  + interactions: Interaction[*]{ordered}
  + suggestions: Suggestion[*]
  - start()
  - stop()

Interaction
  ' unamed
  + prompt: Prompt
  + reponse: Response[0..1]
  + error: Errors[*]
  - fixAll()

Prompt
  ' unamed
  ' Mention data storage in the prompt if required (see _Data and _DataPanel).
  ' Mention AI capabilities in the prompt if required (see _PromptsPanel).
  - content: String[0..1]
  - image: Image[0..1]
  ??? Check the difference with the prompts in _PromptPanel

Image
  ' Mocks, sketches, or screenshots.
  ' Added to a _Prompt.

Error
  - type: runtimeError | ...
  - location: String?  ~ node_modules/.vite/deps/chunk-RUPNRBO7.js:1058:9
  - description: String
  + attachement: ???

Response ...

Debugging
  ' [doc](https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/tutorials/spark/your-first-spark#debugging-your-app)

Suggestion
  - description: String

